Cured silk is a set of lightweight, [[Monk]] specific armor. It is the next step above raw silk and requires silk swatches, heady kiola, and a corresponding pattern. A full set gives 50 AC, with only 1.3 total weight.

This set requires a total of 20 silk swatches and 27 heady kiolas to create. The full set is trivial with a Tailoring skill of 82 and a Brewing skill of 46.

